## Visual Studio (browsing only)

# Cache/options directory
.vs/

# Visual C++ IntelliSense cache files
ipch/
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.cachefile

# Visual Studio cache files
# files ending in .cache can be ignored
*.[Cc]ache
# but keep track of directories ending in .cache
!?*.[Cc]ache/

# Local history
**/.localhistory/
.vshistory/



## Jupyter Notebook

# Checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*



## JetBrains IDEs

# Shared configuration only
.idea/*
!.idea/codeStyles
!.idea/runConfigurations

